<lb n="47"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ersůcht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werden</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dan</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">theyen</unclear> für sich bescheide, die selben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Irer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eiden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">entlaße</unclear>,
<lb n="48"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nitt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hoher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">obri</unclear>- und also den kauf authentisch auf hebe, wann nun
